{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117203","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117203/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117203/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117203/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117203","id":4040255769,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7IzrPK","number":117203,"title":"Use SplitContainer for Node3D Editor viewports","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-03-08T02:42:03Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T20:51:35Z","closed_at":"2026-03-09T20:20:52Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117203","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117203","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117203.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117203.patch","merged_at":"2026-03-09T20:20:52Z"},"body":"The previous approach for the Node3D Editor's viewport container had some issues:\r\n- It used SplitContainer's `separation` but grabbing did not account for `minimum_grab_thickness`. This made it more difficult to grab.\r\n- The splitter icons had rendering issues when dragging (it flickers / doesn't show when dragging in some cases).\r\n- No touch dragger support.\r\n- No accessibility support.\r\n- At compact spacing preset, there was no space between them and it was impossible to drag them.\r\n<img width=\"617\" height=\"382\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9dd770bf-3424-4357-81b9-b3e49b8a2f30\" />\r\n\r\nThese could be fixed on their own, but it is better to just use SplitContainer to handle all of it.\r\n\r\nI changed it to use 3 SplitContainers, one main one and two children. I change their vertical flags when needed to fit the different layouts.\r\nI also made sure that the horizontal/vertical positions would remain the same when switching layouts like before.\r\nThese use the new drag nested intersections SplitContainer option so you can still adjust multiple at once. Also you can drag the intersection between one of these and the docks now. related https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14300\r\n\r\nThe four-way works by disabling the first child split and using the second child's drag margin to expand it over the first, and setting the first child split offset to follow.\r\n\r\nI set minimum size of viewports to 39. This is the value I got when I minimized them on master, not sure why that value or where it is from, but it keeps the behavior the same.\r\n\r\nRemoved the 3-way and 4-way grabber icons. Drag nested intersections handles it by showing both regular grabber icons instead.\r\nThe 3-way icons had another issue too, sometimes it was not aligned correctly. Related https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/74691 \r\n\r\nThe exact viewport that is used for certain positions in some layouts have changed a bit, but I don't think it is that important to keep the same. 2 viewports (including alt) now use indexes 0 and 1 instead of 0 and 2, and 3 viewports alt now uses 0,1,2 instead of 0,2,3.\r\n\r\nI also fixed an issue in SplitContainer where enabling the touch dragger didn't hide it if dragging was disabled until it was sorted, it now updates immediately. Otherwise in the four way, it would show incorrectly for the first split until it gets updated.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"810\" height=\"521\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dd27890f-edda-4625-9a22-5b81b023a684\" />\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117203/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":